; BambuStudio 1.9.0

; Test G-code for brick & mortar processing

G28 ; home all axes

G1 Z0.2 F600

;LAYER_CHANGE

M991 S0 P1 ; notify layer change 1

G1 X10 Y10 E0.1 F1800

G1 X20 Y10 E0.2 F1800

G1 X20 Y20 E0.3 F1800

G1 Z0.4 F600

M991 S0 P2 ; notify layer change 2

G1 X10 Y20 E0.4 F1800

G1 X10 Y10 E0.5 F1800

;LAYER_CHANGE_MORTAR
;BRICK_MORTAR_LAYER 1 at Z=0.500
G1 Z0.500 F600
T1 ;TOOL_CHANGE:1 ; Switch to mortar material
M104 T1 S225
M106 S128
G1 X10.200 Y10.200 E0.10500 F1800

G1 X20.200 Y10.200 E0.21000 F1800

G1 X20.200 Y20.200 E0.31500 F1800

T0 ;TOOL_CHANGE:0 ; Revert to base tool
G1 Z0.6 F600

M991 S0 P3 ; notify layer change 3

G1 X30 Y30 E0.6 F1800

G1 X40 Y30 E0.7 F1800
;LAYER_CHANGE_MORTAR
;BRICK_MORTAR_LAYER 2 at Z=0.700
G1 Z0.700 F600
T1 ;TOOL_CHANGE:1 ; Switch to mortar material
M104 T1 S225
M106 S128
G1 X10.200 Y20.200 E0.42000 F1800

G1 X10.200 Y10.200 E0.52500 F1800

T0 ;TOOL_CHANGE:0 ; Revert to base tool